    "165656720859a9e8d5": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "165656720836c7d25b-0": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Extra Large Access Meeting Booth"
          }
        },
        "165656720836c7d25b-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p>Our large and extra-large access booths are thoughtfully designed with inclusivity in mind, ensuring comfort and accessibility for everyone. Ideal for meetings, events, or personal breaks, these booths cater to diverse needs, offering accessible, private, and comfortable spaces.</p><h3><strong>Key Features:</strong></h3><p><strong>DDA Compliant and Inclusive Meeting Spaces:</strong> Designed to meet diverse accessibility needs, including wheelchair access.</p><p><strong>Soundproof Meeting Booth:</strong> Advanced acoustic design ensures privacy and focus, ideal for busy environments.</p><p><strong>Customisable Options:</strong> Includes height-adjustable optional office chair, fold down sofa bench.</p><p><strong>Accessible Button Design</strong>: \"Push to Open\" button for enhanced accessibility.</p><h3><strong>Spacious and Accessible Design</strong></h3><p><strong>Ample Space for Mobility:</strong> Designed for easy navigation and accommodating wheelchairs.</p><p><strong>Comfortable Group Use:</strong> Spacious enough for multiple users, suitable for group meetings or personal use.</p><h3><strong>Soundproof and Acoustic Design</strong></h3><p><strong>Enhanced Privacy:</strong> Soundproofing ensures a quiet atmosphere for meetings, video calls, and focused, productive working environment.</p><p><strong>Acoustic Design:</strong> PET panels and toughened glass provide excellent sound insulation.</p><h3><strong>Inclusive and Adjustable Features</strong></h3><p><strong>Inclusive Design:</strong> Height-adjustable tables and chairs cater to various physical needs.</p><p><strong>Ergonomic Comfort:</strong> Optional pressure-relieving cushions and ergonomic seating available.</p><h3><strong>Friendly Environment</strong></h3><p><strong>Reduced Noise Levels:</strong> Soundproof panels prevent sensory overload, ideal for individuals with sensory processing disorders.</p><h3><strong>Advanced Communication Technology</strong></h3><p><strong>Accessible Video Conferencing:</strong> Includes assistive technology for seamless communication.</p><p><strong>Inclusive Tools:</strong> Features such as hearing loops, screen readers, and voice-activated systems ensure full participation.</p><h3><strong>Versatile Usage</strong></h3><p><strong>Multi-Purpose Design:</strong> Ideal for meetings, video calls, rest areas, and personal consultations.</p><p><strong>High-Traffic Compatibility:</strong> Suitable for offices, airports, conferences, and public events.</p><h3><strong>Safety and Privacy</strong></h3><p><strong>Enhanced Safety Features:</strong> Non-slip floors, safety rails, and emergency buttons ensure user safety.</p><p><strong>Privacy and Dignity:</strong> Includes private screens and accessible facilities for personal care needs.</p><p>For more information or to inquire about custom solutions, contact us today.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
