        "image_position": "left",
        "mobile_image_position": "top",
        "title": "Mindful In Design",
        "detection": "<p>Primarily an acoustic control company, technically engineers; design-wise, we are creators. Our furniture packs have been developed over years of trials and customer feedback: functional, comfortable, and organic design. Whilst still maintaining hardwearing upholstery, build quality and finish.</p>",
        "button_text": "",
