        "image_position": "right",
        "mobile_image_position": "top",
        "title": "New, Upgraded Lighting",
        "detection": "<p>Soundbox Store now offers as standard additional LED strip lighting 4000k 50Lx Daylight, neatly designed on either side of the meeting and conference booths. Powered separately from the leading central light-creating task or ambient lighting.</p>",
