        "image_position": "left",
        "mobile_image_position": "top",
        "title": "Easy Access Pad",
        "detection": "<p>Designed for accessibility, the door open button provides seamless entry for wheelchair users. The drop table ensures convenience and flexibility, making the space inclusive and user-friendly.</p>",
