        "title": "Power + Bluetooth",
        "detection": "<p>UL & CE Certificated<br/>Bluetooth Control System with speaker, connect devices for calls, zoom calls or music.<br/>Switches for LED lighting and ventilation power.<br/>Motion Sensor - Only use power when in use.<br/>1 * 220-240 Power Socket UK/ EU<br/>2 * USB DC 5V, 2.1A.<br/>1 * USB-C DC 5V, 2.1A.<br/>* Twice as many power outlets with furniture option.</p>",
